stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Waiting: File scope with at least 3 query characters
    Waiting --> Waiting: Query changes / restart debounce
    Waiting --> Searching: 220 ms without edits / start worker
    Searching --> Results: Current generation returns valid matches
    Searching --> Error: Invalid regex, failed worker or timeout
    Searching --> Waiting: Query changes / kill old worker and clear nodes
    Results --> Waiting: Query changes / clear nodes
    Error --> Waiting: Correct query / retry
    Waiting --> Idle: Scope removed or query too short
    Searching --> Idle: Scope removed / kill worker
    Results --> Idle: Scope removed / remove nodes
    Error --> Idle: Scope removed
    note right of Searching
        Independent worker per launcher surface.
        Home files; no hidden entries or symlink traversal.
        At most 60 results, 250000 entries or 3 seconds.
        Only the current generation may publish results.
    end note
